# Molten Note: with X = 1 the three mana spent ({G} from Llanowar Elves, {R} and {W} from the Moxen) are 3 damage to Bot2's
# Gigantosaurus. The Elves were tapped to pay, and "untap all creatures you control" untaps them - Bot1's alone: Bot2's Raging
# Goblin, tapped from attacking on turn 2, stays tapped, and so does Bot1's Mox Ruby, which is no creature.

